# UI / UX

- Clean, minimal Material 3 design
- Support both light and dark mode
- Use good spacing and a modern look
- Make the free trial limit obvious to the user
- Paywall must clearly say **“One-time purchase • No subscription”**

Do not hide remaining free uses. Show a clear limit (e.g. “2 of 5 free lists used”) before prompting Pro.
